flowchart TD
    classDef code fill:#e8eef7,stroke:#4a6fa5,color:#1b2a41
    classDef llm fill:#fdf0e0,stroke:#d9822b,color:#4a2c0a
    classDef human fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#3a8f5c,color:#14321f
    classDef stop fill:#f3f3f3,stroke:#888,color:#333,stroke-dasharray: 4 3

    A[Incoming request<br/>form / email + attachments]:::code
    B[1. Receive & normalise<br/>store raw message, extract attachment text]:::code
    C{2. Duplicate?}:::code
    C1[Link to existing case<br/>log and stop]:::stop
    D[3. Classify<br/>fixed label list]:::llm
    D1{Known type &<br/>confident?}:::code
    E[4. Extract structured data<br/>schema-validated fields + sources]:::llm
    F[5. Retrieve knowledge<br/>vector search over company docs]:::code
    G[6. Check completeness<br/>rules table: required fields & documents]:::code
    H[7. Draft response<br/>grounded in retrieved passages, citations checked]:::llm
    I[8. Propose action<br/>create case, assign owner, set follow-up]:::code
    J[9. Human review<br/>approve / edit / reject<br/>corrections recorded]:::human
    J1[Rejected or escalated<br/>case parked for a person]:::stop
    K[10. Execute<br/>lookup tool, create case, send reply<br/>idempotency keys + retries]:::code
    L[(11. Audit log<br/>inputs, outputs, sources,<br/>corrections, cost, latency)]:::code
    M[Evaluation set & dashboard]:::code

    A --> B --> C
    C -- yes --> C1
    C -- no --> D --> D1
    D1 -- no --> J
    D1 -- yes --> E --> F --> G --> H --> I --> J
    J -- approve --> K
    J -- reject --> J1
    K --> L
    J1 --> L
    C1 --> L
    L --> M

    subgraph Legend
        direction LR
        X1[Deterministic code]:::code
        X2[LLM step, output validated by code]:::llm
        X3[Human decision]:::human
    end
